---
description: PP Skills catalog conventions for this repository
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo is PP Skills, a portable Agent Skills catalog for product and engineering teams.

Canonical skills live in `skills/<audience>/<skill-name>/`. Do not create skills under `.cursor/skills/` here.

When adding or editing a skill, follow `skills/shared/pp-skill-authoring/SKILL.md` and `AGENTS.md`. Run `python3 scripts/validate.py` before finishing.
